# Rank 1518 / CVE-2023-45282: Open MCT's import-from-JSON action
# parsed an uploaded file with a bare JSON.parse and instantiated the
# resulting tree, so a crafted export file with __proto__ keys
# polluted Object.prototype across the application (prototype
# pollution, CWE-1321). onSave in src/plugins/importFromJSONAction/
# ImportFromJSONAction.js did `const objectTree = selectFile.body;
# this._importObjectTree(object, JSON.parse(objectTree))` -- the file
# body arrives from the import dialog's file picker -- and the
# validation twin at :284 parsed the same body bare. Pool commit
# 2243381d52 is the real fix (COMMIT_OK -- "Protect against prototype
# pollution in import action (#7094)"): a new src/utils/sanitization.js
# exports filter__proto__, a JSON.parse reviver returning undefined
# for __proto__ keys, and both parses now run `JSON.parse(objectTree,
# filter__proto__)`; the localStorage provider's parses pass the same
# reviver, and specs assert polluted imports are dropped. No pool
# correction.
#
# ATTENTION, upload-field provenance. The corpus's ProtoPollute sink
# (VYQL-INJ-013) fires on member-assignment shapes (it reported
# path-to-regexp's options parameter at rank 1554), but nothing here
# feeds it: the body arrives as selectFile.body -- a plugin dialog's
# file-picker field, an object property no binding labels as input --
# and the pollution itself happens inside openmct's own instantiate
# merge, a project API boundary (the same shape ranks 1526 and 1545
# recorded). Measured on the real code: scanning
# ImportFromJSONAction.js reports zero findings at both revisions.
# The fix's control -- a JSON.parse reviver dropping __proto__ -- is
# the general guard shape; openmct's filter__proto__ helper is
# project-local, but binding the reviver position of JSON.parse as a
# neutralizer (like the existing safe-deser rules for JSON.parse in
# other languages) is the corpus-level piece. No ENGINE-GAPS.md
# entry. No definition change shipped. Spec cve_rank1518 records the
# bare file-body parse and the reviver-guarded form, both asserting
# reject VYQL-INJ-013: when upload-field provenance lands, the bare
# form must flip to expect.

test "rank1518: the import action parses the uploaded body bare"
  lang javascript
  file src/plugins/importFromJSONAction/ImportFromJSONAction.js
  reject VYQL-INJ-013
  code
  ```
  class ImportFromJSONAction {
    onSave(object, changes) {
      const selectFile = changes.selectFile;
      const objectTree = selectFile.body;
      this._importObjectTree(object, JSON.parse(objectTree));
    }

    _importObjectTree(parent, tree) {
      for (const key in tree) {
        const child = tree[key];
        this.openmct.objects.save(child);
        this._importObjectTree(child, childComposition);
      }
    }
  }
  ```

test "rank1518: the fix drops proto keys through a reviver"
  lang javascript
  file src/plugins/importFromJSONAction/ImportFromJSONAction.js
  reject VYQL-INJ-013
  code
  ```
  function filter__proto__(key, value) {
    if (key !== '__proto__') {
      return value;
    }
  }

  class ImportFromJSONAction {
    onSave(object, changes) {
      const selectFile = changes.selectFile;
      const objectTree = selectFile.body;
      this._importObjectTree(object, JSON.parse(objectTree, filter__proto__));
    }

    _importObjectTree(parent, tree) {
      for (const key in tree) {
        const child = tree[key];
        this.openmct.objects.save(child);
        this._importObjectTree(child, childComposition);
      }
    }
  }
  ```
